| (0,3) | 3 | Yes |
| (0,7) | 7 | Yes |
| (3,3) | 33 | No |
| (3,7) | 37 | Yes |
| (3,7) | 37 | Yes |

**Prime count: 11. Non-prime count: 4. Total: 15.** ✓

Since 6 digits is the minimum length, d₁=1 is the smallest first digit, d₂=d₃=0 are smallest possible, d₄=3 is the smallest that can achieve 11, and d₅=3,d₆=7 is the smallest tail achieving the target, **100337** is the smallest positive integer worth exactly 11 points.

